  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "soar into the air, dealing AoE damage; final hit deals bonus damage and knocks up",
    "skill1": "normal attack becomes long-range penetrating line",
    "skill2": "Passive: gain stacking buffs from allied boosts; Active: increase ATK and ATK SPD",
    "skill3": "ATK speed permanently rises with each normal attack",
    "skill4": "true damage burst available at max buff stacks",
    "skill5": "execution bonus increases while active buff is in effect"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Dionel]] turns normal attacks into long-range penetrating lines and permanently gains ATK SPD with each strike. Allied buffs build stacks that raise ATK and ATK SPD during his active sip, ending in a true-damage burst at maximum stacks. His ultimate soars untargetable, rains area hits, and ends with bonus damage and knock-up. Execution bonuses rise while the active buff lasts. He needs frequent ally buffs and grouped enemies to reach his damage ceiling; unsupported or scattered fights blunt his long scaling pattern.",
  "counter_overview": "[[Dionel]] snowballs ATK SPD from ally buffs into penetrating lines and a true-damage sip burst, then soars untargetable during his ultimate. Do not dump burst into the aerial window. He relocates too often for assassin pins, so use lasting coverage like [[Shemira]] or [[Frieren]], and [[Lily May]] when the soar begins. Pressure his buffer partners with [[filter:backline-inhibit]] like [[Bonnie]] or [[Himmel]] so his stacks never peak."
}
